1
00:00:00,428 --> 00:00:02,348
Great, we'll bring you back a T-shirt.

2
00:00:06,226 --> 00:00:07,356
SHELDON:
Thank you.

3
00:00:08,603 --> 00:00:10,353
Hello, neighbor.

4
00:00:10,522 --> 00:00:12,352
(Penny:)Hello, Sheldon.

5
00:00:12,524 --> 00:00:14,694
And how are you this fine evening?

6
00:00:14,859 --> 00:00:17,859
(Leonard:)- Great.
- Good, I'm glad.

7
00:00:18,029 --> 00:00:20,529
PENNY:
Really? Are you drunk?

8
00:00:20,699 --> 00:00:22,199
(Sheldon:)I'm just in a good mood.

9
00:00:22,367 --> 00:00:24,707
(Sheldon:)While my compatriots are in Las Vegas...

10
00:00:24,869 --> 00:00:29,369
(Sheldon:)...I will be enjoying a blissful evening
in my personal Fortress of Solitude.

11
00:00:29,541 --> 00:00:32,751
That's Superman's big ice thingy, right?

12
00:00:32,961 --> 00:00:36,551
You know, I'm in such a good mood,
I'm actually finding your tenuous grasp...

13
00:00:36,715 --> 00:00:40,175
(Sheldon:)...of the English language
folksy and charming today.

14
00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:43,220
(Penny:)Mmm. What smells so good?

15
00:00:43,388 --> 00:00:47,558
(Sheldon:)That is the intoxicating aroma
of Kadhai Paneer.

16
00:00:47,726 --> 00:00:50,896
(Sheldon:)A perfect culinary representation
of the freedom this evening holds.

17
00:00:51,062 --> 00:00:54,022
(Sheldon:)Not only is it Indian cuisine,
which Koothrappali loathes...

18
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:56,320
(Sheldon:)...it contains a generous helping
of peanuts...

19
00:00:56,484 --> 00:01:01,024
(Sheldon:)...which would reduce Wolowitz
to a wheezing 97-pound blister.

